cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this behavioral model, please cite it as below."
title: "SAR20-5: Behavioral Simulink Model of a 20-bit 5 MS/s Two-Step SAR ADC"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB/Simulink behavioral model of a 5 MS/s two-step SAR ADC with a
  10-bit discrete-time first stage, 32x residue amplification / auto-zero,
  an 11-bit continuous-time second stage, 12 D2 decisions and 8 tracking
  comparisons with 7 physical feedback updates. The current released normal
  operating point is a single N=256 coherent FFT with SNDR 99.133 dB and
  ENOB 16.17 bit. This is a behavioral modeling project, not a reproduction
  of the UESTC CICC 2026 silicon results and not a signoff artifact.
type: software
authors:
