notes: >-
  Reproduction status: NOT REPRODUCED. The UESTC CICC 2026 paper has not been
  reproduced; no acceptance criteria for reproduction have been defined in the
  project, and the current normal baseline is not single-source attributable.
  Metrics must not be cited as validation of the paper, as DNL/INL, as a 20k-point
  spectrum, or as power/area/PDK results. See docs/ENGINEERING_ANALYSIS.md.
